<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <fullName>Answer_Choice__c</fullName>
    <description>The option chosen, as a picklist, so a chart can give each answer a fixed color and list answers in scale order. Holds the option as stored, not a label customized on the form, so a renamed option keeps its color and its place: the stored value of a picklist answer, Yes or No for a checkbox, the number chosen on a Likert number scale, and No Response for a choice question shown and left unanswered. Blank for every other answer. Lists the options of the scale questions the package ships, in scale order; the worded scales run red to green from lowest to highest, and the numbered options carry no fixed color because 1 to 5 belongs to both the 1 to 5 rating and the 0 to 10 scale. Not restricted: a customer&apos;s own option is written as it is, uncolored and unordered until it is added to this picklist.</description>
    <inlineHelpText>The option chosen. Charts grouped by this field use each value&apos;s chart color and list values in this picklist&apos;s order.</inlineHelpText>
    <label>Answer Choice</label>
    <required>false</required>
    <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
    <type>Picklist</type>
